 R←Test_ListDirs2_004(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;list;parms;noOf;list2
⍝ Test the `ListDirs2` method with a wilcard search pattern
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 parms←⎕NS''
 parms.recurse←2
 parms.depth←¯1
 list←parms ##.FilesAndDirs.ListDirs2'./Tests/Test Dir/o*'

 noOf←+/##.FilesAndDirs.IsDir list
 →T.PassesIf 4=noOf
 list2←⊃parms ##.FilesAndDirs.Dir2'./Tests/Test Dir/'
 list2←('o'={⊃⊃,/1↓⎕NPARTS ⍵}¨list2)/list2
 →T.PassesIf noOf=+/##.FilesAndDirs.IsDir list2

 R←T._OK
